{"seq":3,"slug":"pragmas-and-configuration","title":"Pragma 与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/pragmas-and-configuration","wordCount":813,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"pragma-与配置\">Pragma 与配置</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>PRAGMA</strong> 是 SQLite 特有的配置接口，用于查询和修改引擎的内部运行参数，也是控制 SQLite 行为的主要手段。Pragma 按作用范围分为两类：<strong>数据库级</strong>（如 <code>journal_mode</code>、<code>page_size</code>）会写入数据库文件并持久生效，<strong>连接级</strong>（如 <code>cache_size</code>、<code>synchronous</code>）只影响当前连接。理解这一持久性差异，是正确配置 SQLite 的前提。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pragma-概述\">Pragma 概述</h2><p><strong>PRAGMA</strong> 是 SQLite 特有的 SQL 扩展，用于查询和修改数据库引擎的内部运行参数。Pragma 不是标准 SQL 的一部分，但它是控制 SQLite 行为的主要手段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查询类 Pragma&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode;&#10;PRAGMA page_size;&#10;&#10;-- 设置类 Pragma&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;&#10;PRAGMA cache_size = -64000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询类 Pragma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA page_size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 设置类 Pragma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Pragma 的作用范围分为两类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用范围</th>\n<th>持久性</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据库级</td>\n<td>写入数据库</td>\n<td>journal_mode, page_size</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接级</td>\n<td>仅当前连接</td>\n<td>cache_size, synchronous</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志模式\">日志模式</h2><p><strong>journal_mode</strong> 控制 SQLite 如何管理事务日志，直接影响写入性能和并发能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 日志模式&#10;        DELETE[DELETE&lt;br/&gt;默认模式]&#10;        TRUNCATE[TRUNCATE]&#10;        PERSIST[PERSIST]&#10;        WAL_MODE[WAL&lt;br/&gt;推荐模式]&#10;        MEMORY[MEMORY]&#10;        OFF[OFF]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 日志模式\n        DELETE[DELETE&lt;br/&gt;默认模式]\n        TRUNCATE[TRUNCATE]\n        PERSIST[PERSIST]\n        WAL_MODE[WAL&lt;br/&gt;推荐模式]\n        MEMORY[MEMORY]\n        OFF[OFF]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>写入性能</th>\n<th>并发读写</th>\n<th>崩溃安全</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DELETE</td>\n<td>事务结束时删除日志文件</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRUNCATE</td>\n<td>事务结束时截断日志文件</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PERSIST</td>\n<td>保留日志文件但清空头部</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAL</td>\n<td>使用预写日志</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MEMORY</td>\n<td>日志仅存于内存</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OFF</td>\n<td>不使用日志</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 切换到 WAL 模式（推荐）&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;&#10;&#10;-- 查看当前日志模式&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 切换到 WAL 模式（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看当前日志模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WAL 模式是大多数应用的最佳选择。它允许读写并发，并且写入性能优于传统的回滚日志模式。切换到 WAL 后，数据库目录会多出 <code>-wal</code> 和 <code>-shm</code> 两个辅助文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"同步模式\">同步模式</h2><p><strong>synchronous</strong> 控制 SQLite 在关键时刻是否等待操作系统将数据刷入磁盘。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 同步级别&#10;        OFF_S[OFF = 0&lt;br/&gt;不同步]&#10;        NORMAL_S[NORMAL = 1&lt;br/&gt;关键点同步]&#10;        FULL_S[FULL = 2&lt;br/&gt;每次提交同步]&#10;        EXTRA_S[EXTRA = 3&lt;br/&gt;额外同步]&#10;    end&#10;    OFF_S --&gt;|性能高&lt;br/&gt;风险高| NORMAL_S --&gt;|平衡| FULL_S --&gt;|安全高&lt;br/&gt;性能低| EXTRA_S\">graph LR\n    subgraph 同步级别\n        OFF_S[OFF = 0&lt;br/&gt;不同步]\n        NORMAL_S[NORMAL = 1&lt;br/&gt;关键点同步]\n        FULL_S[FULL = 2&lt;br/&gt;每次提交同步]\n        EXTRA_S[EXTRA = 3&lt;br/&gt;额外同步]\n    end\n    OFF_S --&gt;|性能高&lt;br/&gt;风险高| NORMAL_S --&gt;|平衡| FULL_S --&gt;|安全高&lt;br/&gt;性能低| EXTRA_S</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>WAL 模式下推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OFF</td>\n<td>不调用 fsync，最快但可能丢数据</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NORMAL</td>\n<td>关键检查点同步</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FULL</td>\n<td>每次事务提交都调用 fsync</td>\n<td>否（过度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTRA</td>\n<td>FULL 基础上额外同步</td>\n<td>否（过度）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- WAL 模式下推荐 NORMAL&#10;PRAGMA synchronous = NORMAL;&#10;&#10;-- 回滚日志模式下推荐 FULL&#10;PRAGMA synchronous = FULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- WAL 模式下推荐 NORMAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA synchronous </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NORMAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 回滚日志模式下推荐 FULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA synchronous </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FULL;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存配置\">缓存配置</h2><p><strong>cache_size</strong> 控制 SQLite 在内存中缓存的页面数量，对查询性能有直接影响。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 设置缓存为 64MB（负数表示 KB）&#10;PRAGMA cache_size = -64000;&#10;&#10;-- 查看当前缓存大小&#10;PRAGMA cache_size;&#10;&#10;-- 查看默认缓存大小（持久化设置）&#10;PRAGMA default_cache_size;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 设置缓存为 64MB（负数表示 KB）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看当前缓存大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看默认缓存大小（持久化设置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA default_cache_size;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正数 N</td>\n<td>缓存 N 个页面</td>\n<td>cache_size = 2000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负数 -N</td>\n<td>缓存约 N KB</td>\n<td>cache_size = -64000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>mmap_size</strong> 允许 SQLite 通过内存映射方式访问数据库文件，减少系统调用开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 启用 256MB 内存映射&#10;PRAGMA mmap_size = 268435456;&#10;&#10;-- 禁用内存映射&#10;PRAGMA mmap_size = 0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 启用 256MB 内存映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA mmap_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 268435456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 禁用内存映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA mmap_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 内存映射在只读场景下效果最佳。对于频繁写入的场景，传统的缓存模式可能更合适，因为 mmap 的页面失效处理会增加开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"其他关键-pragma\">其他关键 Pragma</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 外键约束（默认关闭！）&#10;PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;&#10;&#10;-- 自动回收空间&#10;PRAGMA auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL;&#10;&#10;-- 启用递增式 vacuum&#10;PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(100);&#10;&#10;-- 查看数据库完整性&#10;PRAGMA integrity_check;&#10;&#10;-- 快速完整性检查&#10;PRAGMA quick_check;&#10;&#10;-- 查看表结构&#10;PRAGMA table_info(users);&#10;&#10;-- 查看索引列表&#10;PRAGMA index_list(users);&#10;&#10;-- 查看编译选项&#10;PRAGMA compile_options;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 外键约束（默认关闭！）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA foreign_keys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 自动回收空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA auto_vacuum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INCREMENTAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 启用递增式 vacuum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看数据库完整性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA integrity_check;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 快速完整性检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA quick_check;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看表结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA table_info(users);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看索引列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA index_list(users);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看编译选项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA compile_options;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用配置组合推荐：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生产环境推荐配置&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;&#10;PRAGMA synchronous = NORMAL;&#10;PRAGMA cache_size = -64000;&#10;PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;&#10;PRAGMA busy_timeout = 5000;&#10;PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint = 1000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生产环境推荐配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA synchronous </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NORMAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA foreign_keys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA busy_timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 开发/测试环境配置&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;&#10;PRAGMA synchronous = OFF;&#10;PRAGMA cache_size = -128000;&#10;PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;&#10;PRAGMA temp_store = MEMORY;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 开发/测试环境配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA synchronous </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OFF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA foreign_keys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA temp_store </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MEMORY;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pragma-配置矩阵\">Pragma 配置矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Pragma</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>推荐值（生产）</th>\n<th>持久性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>journal_mode</td>\n<td>DELETE</td>\n<td>WAL</td>\n<td>数据库级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>synchronous</td>\n<td>FULL</td>\n<td>NORMAL（WAL）</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cache_size</td>\n<td>-2000</td>\n<td>-64000</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>foreign_keys</td>\n<td>OFF</td>\n<td>ON</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>busy_timeout</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>5000</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mmap_size</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>268435456</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wal_autocheckpoint</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>temp_store</td>\n<td>DEFAULT</td>\n<td>MEMORY</td>\n<td>连接级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>auto_vacuum</td>\n<td>NONE</td>\n<td>INCREMENTAL</td>\n<td>数据库级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Pragma 与配置))&#10;    日志模式&#10;      DELETE 默认&#10;      WAL 推荐&#10;      MEMORY 仅测试&#10;    同步模式&#10;      FULL 最安全&#10;      NORMAL WAL 推荐&#10;      OFF 仅测试&#10;    缓存配置&#10;      cache_size&#10;      mmap_size&#10;      temp_store&#10;    关键 Pragma&#10;      foreign_keys&#10;      busy_timeout&#10;      auto_vacuum&#10;      integrity_check&#10;    配置策略&#10;      生产环境&#10;      开发测试\">mindmap\n  root((Pragma 与配置))\n    日志模式\n      DELETE 默认\n      WAL 推荐\n      MEMORY 仅测试\n    同步模式\n      FULL 最安全\n      NORMAL WAL 推荐\n      OFF 仅测试\n    缓存配置\n      cache_size\n      mmap_size\n      temp_store\n    关键 Pragma\n      foreign_keys\n      busy_timeout\n      auto_vacuum\n      integrity_check\n    配置策略\n      生产环境\n      开发测试</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>PRAGMA</strong> 是 SQLite 配置的主要手段，分为数据库级（持久化）和连接级（仅当前连接）。</li>\n<li><strong>WAL</strong> 日志模式是大多数场景的最佳选择，提供读写并发和更优的写入性能。</li>\n<li>WAL 模式下推荐 <strong>synchronous = NORMAL</strong>，在安全性和性能之间取得平衡。</li>\n<li><strong>cache_size</strong> 和 <strong>mmap_size</strong> 直接影响查询性能，应根据可用内存合理配置。</li>\n<li><strong>foreign_keys</strong> 默认关闭，需要在每个连接上手动启用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pragma 与配置","id":"pragma-与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Pragma 概述","id":"pragma-概述"},{"level":2,"text":"日志模式","id":"日志模式"},{"level":2,"text":"同步模式","id":"同步模式"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存配置","id":"缓存配置"},{"level":2,"text":"其他关键 Pragma","id":"其他关键-pragma"},{"level":2,"text":"Pragma 配置矩阵","id":"pragma-配置矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据类型与亲和性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/data-types-and-affinity"},"next":{"title":"SQLite vs 客户端/服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/sqlite-vs-client-server"}}